title = "MEMORANDUM: SHIFT 3"
body = "To: Sub-surface Maintenance Crew
From: Facilities Oversight

All primary power conduits to the deep water pumps have been rerouted through three secondary breakers along the catwalk grid.

Under no circumstances should the deep pool remain unlit. If the water displacement sensor triggers, throw the breakers and proceed immediately to the overlook console."

